Per airport x month. matched = own run matched (same runway, +-120 s); entry = own 1 km entry measured;
reach1/2 = >= 1/2 other same-runway runs with a measured entry in [T-15, T+10] min; pushback = v4 tier;
deice = matched runs with a long stop > 1 km from the roll start (not the first stop)

